---
import Navbar from '../Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../Footer.astro';
import LegalHeader from '../ui/LegalHeader.astro';
import LegalSection from '../ui/LegalSection.astro';
---

<Navbar />

<main class="pt-32 pb-24 px-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">

  <LegalHeader title="User Manual" updated="May 2026" />

  <div class="space-y-12 text-fg-subtle leading-relaxed">

    <LegalSection title="1. Connect your Server (SMB/WebDAV)">
      <p>Go to the "Servers" tab and tap the "+" button. Choose your protocol (<strong>SMB</strong> for Windows/Mac/NAS, <strong>WebDAV</strong> for remote servers). Enter your IP address, port, username, and password. Mivio will automatically scan the folders you select.</p>
    </LegalSection>

    <LegalSection title="2. Automatic Metadata">
      <p>When you add a server, Mivio will try to match your video files with <strong>TMDB</strong>. For best results, name your files clearly (e.g., "Movie Name (2023).mp4" or "Show S01E01.mkv"). If a match is wrong, you can long-press the item and select "Fix Match".</p>
    </LegalSection>

    <LegalSection title="3. Subtitles">
      <p>During playback, tap the subtitle icon. You can select an embedded subtitle track, a local file, or tap "Search Online" to download subtitles from <strong>OpenSubtitles</strong> automatically based on the video hash.</p>
    </LegalSection>

    <LegalSection title="4. Player Controls">
      <p>Swipe left/right to seek. Swipe up/down on the left side to adjust brightness, and on the right side for volume. Double tap the edges to skip 10 seconds.</p>
    </LegalSection>

  </div>
</main>

<Footer />
